  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At the lakeside, Ren Zu seizes a wine bowl and names the water the bewitching soup that muddles ghosts and strips their desire to leave. Verdant Great Sun answers that the same water is soul calming wine, which calms the soul, removes impurities, and ranks among the world’s best wines. Fairness Gu later calls the place obsession death domain, the world’s most tranquil place.",
      "chapters": [
        411
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ren_zu",
        "char_verdant_great_sun",
        "gu_fairness_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Verdant Great Sun, turned into a white ghost, lies beside a lake and scoops the water with a bowl. The water is like wine, and its fragrance pervades the area. The lake sits in a death domain of endless darkness, the deepest part of the Door of Life and Death.",
      "chapters": [
        411
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
